- entry .contains   `tuple.contains[T]`: whether a tuple type has a component of a type, at compile time
-     An inline, erased extension on a `Tuple`: `(erasedValue[(Int, Text)]).contains[Text]` is
-     `true`, computed from the types. Not exported to the `soundness` umbrella.
